    <item>
      <title>1.1 Introduzione</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/sono/posts/1.1/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/sono/posts/1.1/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Mandiant M-Trend report importante&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;BLUE TEAM TRUTH&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;blue-team-truth&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#blue-team-truth&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;1 la compromissione avverra&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;1-la-compromissione-avverra&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#1-la-compromissione-avverra&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;non tutti attaccanti verranno bloccati al perimetro , questo migliora il soc&#xA;goal: detect e minimizzare danno&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;2 le aziende non esistono solo per essere sicure&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;2-le-aziende-non-esistono-solo-per-essere-sicure&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;span&#xD;&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#2-le-aziende-non-esistono-solo-per-essere-sicure&#34; aria-label=&#34;Ancora&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ridurre il rischio ad un livello accettabile&#xA;balance tra produttivita e sicurezza&#xA;balance deciso da managment (possiamo influenzare)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
